# Build output. `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` may point elsewhere; this covers the default.
/target/
**/target/

# Release archives and their checksum file, written by
# `packaging/build-release-asset.sh`. They are attached to a GitHub release,
# never committed: the digest changes on every rebuild of the same source.
/dist/

# Review notes, one per project, deliberately not shared.
BACKLOG.md

# Internal operating notes: how work is staged, gated and landed here. The
# public repository carries contributor-facing rules only, so this directory
# is deliberately not shared and must never be committed.
/.internal/

# Capture artifacts. Scoped, NOT a global *.png: a blanket rule would silently
# swallow the first icon or asset anybody adds under app/assets.
/harness/out/
/*.png
/*.ppm

# Editor and OS leavings.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
